flowchart TD
  A[Candidate bytes] --> B{Explicit non-DAAD rejection?}
  B -- yes --> X[Unverified with reason]
  B -- no --> C[Candidate raw / validated wrapper offsets]
  C --> D[Parse DRC or legacy header]
  D --> E{Length and target fields valid?}
  E -- no --> X
  E -- yes --> F[Resolve target address and pointer offsets]
  F --> G{Pointers in bounded payload?}
  G -- no --> X
  G -- yes --> H[Validate process entries and terminated streams]
  H -- no --> X
  H -- yes --> I[Verified structural DDB evidence]
  I --> J[Correlate interpreter separately]
